Below is an interactive rendering of a $2$-manifold $\manifold$ as a subset of  $\bbR^3$.
As you move your mouse around $\manifold$ in the left-hand figure, the hovered point $\point \in \manifold$ is associated with a chart $(\open, \chart)$.
The right-hand figure shows the coordinate domain identification $\chart(\open) \subseteq\bbR^2$ and the coordinate $\chart(\point) \in \bbR^2$.
As you move your mouse around over $\chart(\open) \subseteq \bbR^2$, you can see its homeomorphic identification with $\open \subseteq \manifold$.

